ow = one differential test, randomised inputs, fixed seed)\n\n| #  | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | ✔ |\n|----|----------------|-------------------------------------------|---|\n| 1  | exported data symbols | read `cp_fixed_table`, `cp_permutation_order`, `cp_len_extra_bits`, `cp_len_base`, `cp_dist_extra_bits`, `cp_dist_base`, `cp_error_reason` right after `dlopen` and compare all bytes | [x] |\n| 2  | `convert_pix` | `bpp=1`, `w,h` ∈ {(1,1),(1,7),(7,1),(3,5),(17,13),(64,3)}, random `src`, 256 random cases | [x] |\n| 3  | `convert_pix` | `bpp=2`, same shape sweep, 256 random cases | [x] |\n| 4  | `convert_pix` | `bpp=3`, same shape sweep, 256 random cases | [x] |\n| 5  | `convert_pix` | `bpp=4`, same shape sweep, 256 random cases | [x] |\n| 6  | `convert_pix` | `bpp ∈ {0,5,6,255,-1,-4,INT_MIN,INT_MAX}` (no `switch` arm): `dst` must stay untouched, `src` walk must not fault | [x] |\n| 7  | `convert_pix` | degenerate shapes `w=0`, `h=0`, `w<0`, `h<0`, `w=INT_MIN`, `h=INT_MIN`, and NULL `src`/`dst` with `h<=0` | [x] |\n| 8  | `cp_inflate` / stored | `btype=0`, `bfinal=1`, `LEN=0`, aligned `in`, exact `out` | [x] |\n| 9  | `cp_inflate` / stored | `btype=0`, `bfinal=1`, `LEN ∈ {1,2,3,4,7,8,31,255,4096}` random payload, `out_bytes` exact | [x] |\n| 10 | `cp_inflate` / stored | as #9 but `in` at every alignment `(in&3) ∈ {0,1,2,3}` (drives `first_bytes` 0/3/2/1) × `LEN ∈ {0..9, 100, 1000}` | [x] |\n| 11 | `cp_inflate` / stored | as #9 but `out_bytes` larger than `LEN` (slack) and `out` buffer pre-filled with a random pattern (checks nothing else is touched) | [x] |\n| 12 | `cp_inflate` / stored | stored block whose `memcpy` writes past `out_end` (`out_bytes < LEN`) – the C has **no** bounds check here, so both must overrun identically into the padded arena | [x] |\n| 13 | `cp_inflate` / fixed | `btype=1`, `bfinal=1`, empty block (EOB only), `out_bytes ∈ {0,1,64}` | [x] |\n| 14 | `cp_inflate` / fixed | literals only, all four fixed-code length